  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2450243584
    m_Localized: SHAPE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437888
    m_Localized: of
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437889
    m_Localized: MEMORY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437890
    m_Localized: SHAPE OF MEMORY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437891
    m_Localized: LOOK AT THE BOOK, PINCH AND SWEEP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437892
    m_Localized: or pinch its cover's edge and flip it open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437893
    m_Localized: PINCH THE COVER'S <em>GLOWING EDGE</em>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437894
    m_Localized: and flip it open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437895
    m_Localized: CLICK THE COVER TO FLIP IT OPEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437896
    m_Localized: TO THE READER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437897
    m_Localized: TURN A PAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437898
    m_Localized: Click its <em>glowing edge</em>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437899
    m_Localized: Pinch its <em>glowing edge</em> and carry it over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437900
    m_Localized: PRESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437901
    m_Localized: Click a tile or a button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437902
    m_Localized: Touch a tile or a button with a fingertip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437903
    m_Localized: TURN THE OBJECTS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437904
    m_Localized: Drag the rings around them, any way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437905
    m_Localized: Pinch a ring around them and drag, any way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437906
    m_Localized: Or look at any of them and pinch, wherever your hand is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437907
    m_Localized: Every pile on this table hides a picture in its shadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437908
    m_Localized: Every memory is found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454437909
    m_Localized: '{0} of {1} memories found.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 714218833402396768
  - m_Id: 2458632192
    m_Localized: Turn the page to begin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826496
    m_Localized: LOWER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826497
    m_Localized: RAISE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826498
    m_Localized: 'Table

      height'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826499
    m_Localized: CHAPTER {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 714218833402396768
  - m_Id: 2462826500
    m_Localized: LOCKED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826501
    m_Localized: Found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826502
    m_Localized: Find the memory before it first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826503
    m_Localized: Not found yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826504
    m_Localized: This page is still blank.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826505
    m_Localized: 'Hold still: the memory opens.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826506
    m_Localized: PLAY AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826507
    m_Localized: FOUND
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826508
    m_Localized: The objects in the rings cast a shadow on the lit page. <em>Turn
      them</em> until it shows a picture.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826509
    m_Localized: The answer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826510
    m_Localized: Turn this page back to leave the memory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826511
    m_Localized: Turn the page
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826512
    m_Localized: PAUSED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826513
    m_Localized: RESUME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826515
    m_Localized: Find the last memory to finish the book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826516
    m_Localized: THANK YOU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826517
    m_Localized: for playing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826518
    m_Localized: to come
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826519
    m_Localized: HINT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826520
    m_Localized: HOLD TO RESET
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826522
    m_Localized: LOOK AT THE OBJECTS, PINCH AND DRAG
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826523
    m_Localized: or pinch a ring around them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826524
    m_Localized: PINCH A RING AND DRAG
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826525
    m_Localized: DRAG THE RINGS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2462826526
